WEBVTT

00:03.760 --> 00:06.110
Save... me...

00:07.130 --> 00:10.220
<i>She's... not human...</i>

00:11.640 --> 00:14.040
<i>Just what race is she?</i>

00:16.090 --> 00:19.540
Who are you?

00:20.090 --> 00:21.430
Who am <i>I</i>?

00:22.780 --> 00:23.860
Rinne.

00:24.350 --> 00:27.320
Rinne. Is that your name?

00:28.460 --> 00:31.670
Please. Help me.

00:32.550 --> 00:33.660
H-Hey!

00:35.570 --> 00:37.890
<i><i>She's not a demon, is she?</i></i>

00:50.770 --> 00:54.280
You'd better not attack me 
after I save you, all right?

01:04.900 --> 01:06.870
Even that wasn't able to break it?

01:07.810 --> 01:09.990
But I don't have any other weapons on me...

01:10.850 --> 01:13.590
Oh yeah. What if I use <i>that</i> sword on it?

01:14.290 --> 01:18.000
I think it was... Code Holder.

01:31.350 --> 01:34.730
It's Sid's... sword.

01:48.620 --> 01:52.670
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

03:06.040 --> 03:10.960
<b>Episode 2
"Rinne"</b>

03:31.980 --> 03:33.850
Hey, are you all right?

03:35.190 --> 03:36.430
Are you awake?

03:45.860 --> 03:48.920
Vanessa!

03:48.920 --> 03:49.580
What the?!

03:49.580 --> 03:51.150
Come out right now!

03:51.150 --> 03:53.080
I haven't lost to you yet!

03:53.470 --> 03:56.450
You really think you could stop me 
by sending this wimpy low-rank demon?!

03:56.450 --> 03:57.560
Wait! I'm—

03:57.560 --> 04:00.480
Hurry up and bring her here at once!

04:12.950 --> 04:16.520
<i>The Code Holder can sever fate.</i>

04:19.900 --> 04:24.720
<i>Separate the needless 
fate of death from this world.</i>

04:36.690 --> 04:37.630
No way.

04:37.970 --> 04:40.590
The magic... disappeared?

04:41.730 --> 04:44.170
What was that just now?!
You're just a lowly demon!

04:44.170 --> 04:46.520
I'm not a demon! I'm a human!

04:46.520 --> 04:48.350
What? A human?

04:48.350 --> 04:52.350
Take a good look. 
I don't have wings or a tail, do I?

04:52.740 --> 04:54.960
You asked for help, so I helped.

04:54.960 --> 04:57.380
Could you please realize 
that I'm not your enemy?

04:58.020 --> 05:00.100
I'm... sorry.

05:00.100 --> 05:03.360
I have a grudge against demons, 
so I couldn't help myself.

05:04.070 --> 05:06.030
A grudge against demons, huh?

05:07.500 --> 05:11.040
Then that means you're not a demon, right?

05:11.040 --> 05:11.830
Yeah.

05:12.690 --> 05:15.130
Then what race are you?

05:15.640 --> 05:18.210
Does it matter what race I am?

05:18.790 --> 05:21.320
I thank you for saving me.

05:21.320 --> 05:23.230
I'll even apologize for attacking you!

05:23.700 --> 05:24.300
But...

05:25.380 --> 05:27.780
don't ask me about my race.

05:27.780 --> 05:28.740
Please.

05:29.790 --> 05:31.010
All right.

05:33.090 --> 05:35.870
I'm happy you understand, human.

05:35.870 --> 05:36.920
It's Kai.

05:36.920 --> 05:37.910
Huh?

05:37.910 --> 05:40.410
I'm not used to being called "human."

05:40.410 --> 05:42.520
Kai. All right, Kai.

05:43.950 --> 05:45.940
I'm Rinne.

05:48.180 --> 05:50.660
Rinne, I want to ask you something.

05:51.070 --> 05:52.690
Do you know where we are?

05:52.690 --> 05:53.930
I don't.

05:53.930 --> 05:58.290
I was fighting against Vanessa 
and before I knew it I was imprisoned here.

05:58.290 --> 06:01.930
Vanessa? The Dark Empress Vanessa?!

06:02.510 --> 06:04.520
The hero of the demons?!

06:04.520 --> 06:05.630
Yeah, why?

06:05.630 --> 06:08.100
You picked a fight with a hero?

06:08.640 --> 06:11.640
Rinne, are you really that strong?

06:11.640 --> 06:13.060
That's right!

06:13.060 --> 06:15.350
I could wipe out a whole army of demons!

06:16.340 --> 06:19.220
But, you're amazing, too, Kai.

06:19.220 --> 06:21.770
How did you cancel my magic?

06:21.770 --> 06:24.720
That's probably thanks to this sword—

06:30.890 --> 06:34.120
Fate singularity entity ???????????? has awakened.

06:34.610 --> 06:38.250
Threat level to new world 
determined as "worst".

06:39.780 --> 06:42.630
Commence removal of Last Risers seal.

06:59.570 --> 07:00.770
Are you kidding me?!

07:06.850 --> 07:08.140
Let's run for it, Rinne!

07:26.380 --> 07:27.960
No!

07:27.960 --> 07:28.630
Rinne!

07:30.040 --> 07:33.260
Fate singularity entity ???????????? captured.

07:33.830 --> 07:35.940
Starting zero code.

07:39.060 --> 07:42.350
No... No!

07:42.350 --> 07:43.150
<i>Am I...</i>

07:49.740 --> 07:51.570
What's wrong with me?!

07:52.300 --> 07:54.450
Don't just stand there!

07:57.580 --> 08:01.080
Sid! I'm going to borrow your sword!

08:14.310 --> 08:16.420
<i>The forbidden sword.</i>

08:16.420 --> 08:17.470
<i>Why is it here?</i>

08:17.840 --> 08:18.680
Let's go!

08:18.680 --> 08:19.530
Yeah!

08:35.100 --> 08:38.190
Did we manage... to escape?

08:41.130 --> 08:42.450
R-Rinne?

08:43.550 --> 08:45.030
I was scared.

08:46.170 --> 08:47.330
I see.

08:48.200 --> 08:51.550
I was so scared, and...

08:56.070 --> 08:57.400
You're so warm.

08:58.310 --> 09:00.630
Isn't there anyone with you?

09:00.630 --> 09:02.270
No, no one.

09:03.630 --> 09:07.100
This is the first time anyone has 
done something like this for me.

09:08.920 --> 09:12.560
I was told by the celestials, the spirits, 
and even the mythical beasts

09:13.070 --> 09:15.700
that I'm not "one of them."

09:16.430 --> 09:18.750
The demons were the cruelest of them all.

09:19.230 --> 09:21.700
They called me an unsightly abomination.

09:22.790 --> 09:25.790
That's why I got into a big fight with Vanessa.

09:26.320 --> 09:27.690
I see...

09:29.380 --> 09:30.380
It's the same for me.

09:31.490 --> 09:37.650
Nobody remembers me, 
and I feel like I'm all alone in the world.

09:39.160 --> 09:41.300
The history I remember is one

09:41.690 --> 09:44.520
where humans won 
the Great War of the Five Races.

09:45.450 --> 09:50.560
But in this world, it seems the demons 
are occupying our cities.

09:51.450 --> 09:53.340
Wait, Kai!

09:53.340 --> 09:56.200
What do you mean, demons 
have occupied human cities?

09:56.200 --> 09:58.330
I've never heard of such a thing.

09:58.330 --> 09:58.860
What?

09:58.860 --> 10:02.960
I think that, right before 
I got into a fight with Vanessa,

10:02.960 --> 10:05.690
the humans were starting to win.

10:06.080 --> 10:09.250
That's right! The demons 
were making a fuss about it...

10:09.250 --> 10:11.150
They said humanity's hero had arrived.

10:11.150 --> 10:13.030
You know about Sid?!

10:13.030 --> 10:14.320
Sid?

10:14.860 --> 10:15.960
Sid...

10:16.300 --> 10:17.380
Come on!

10:18.460 --> 10:19.560
I don't know.

10:20.670 --> 10:22.030
Sorry.

10:23.100 --> 10:24.580
But I'm glad.

10:25.820 --> 10:30.010
We remember the same history.
 I think we're the same.

10:31.180 --> 10:32.230
We're the same?

10:32.670 --> 10:33.920
What?

10:33.920 --> 10:37.670
You're the first person 
to ever say that about me, Kai.

10:37.670 --> 10:40.820
Well, that goes for me, too. It's the first 
time I've ever said something like that.

10:41.770 --> 10:43.190
I see.

10:44.410 --> 10:46.620
Then we're the same!

10:51.680 --> 10:53.260
We made it out safely.

10:54.360 --> 10:56.380
What do you plan on doing now?

10:56.380 --> 10:58.780
Well, for now...

11:00.820 --> 11:01.590
Rinne?!

11:02.100 --> 11:03.680
Was it because you were attacked earlier?

11:07.770 --> 11:09.040
Hey, Rinne...

11:09.550 --> 11:11.400
I plan on going back to the city.

11:12.280 --> 11:14.270
If you don't have any place to go, 
why not come with me?

11:16.470 --> 11:18.380
I don't want to go to a human city.

11:19.080 --> 11:20.070
Why?

11:20.630 --> 11:23.010
I can't trust anyone.

11:23.010 --> 11:23.740
How about me?

11:24.050 --> 11:25.740
You're different, Kai!

11:25.740 --> 11:28.250
You saved me, after all.

11:28.560 --> 11:31.310
Then trust me and come with me.

11:31.940 --> 11:35.680
You can always leave if you can't trust anyone.

11:37.400 --> 11:38.960
All right.

11:39.010 --> 11:41.970
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

11:42.050 --> 11:44.970
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

11:51.930 --> 11:53.310
I'm exhausted.

11:55.140 --> 11:57.980
H-Hey! I can't see the road!

11:55.140 --> 11:58.440
Let me out!

11:55.660 --> 11:58.440
She caused a panic in the car...

11:59.180 --> 12:01.700
It's great that she was able 
to hide her wings, but...

12:02.410 --> 12:04.840
Even so, she stands out like a sore thumb.

12:02.610 --> 12:05.490
Oh, I hope they don't bite.

12:05.850 --> 12:07.780
Don't talk to me!

12:08.940 --> 12:11.370
Let me go!

12:08.940 --> 12:12.550
In the end, she even tried to 
use magic in the middle of the city.

12:13.460 --> 12:16.330
She's surrounded by people 
she's not familiar with,

12:16.330 --> 12:18.640
so I guess it can't be helped 
that she's so cautious.

12:21.990 --> 12:24.500
I didn't know races besides humans sang.

12:26.650 --> 12:29.100
<i>Before I knew it, it turned back 
into its original form.</i>

12:35.560 --> 12:36.230
Code—

12:36.980 --> 12:38.480
There's trouble, Kai!

12:38.480 --> 12:39.150
Wha?!

12:39.150 --> 12:41.940
What should I do?! The water won't stop!

12:42.730 --> 12:44.480
What's wrong, Kai?

12:44.480 --> 12:47.050
I'm fine! Just wrap yourself 
with the bath towel, all right?!

12:47.050 --> 12:49.120
It's bad for my heart.

12:51.030 --> 12:53.970
Kai, humans are so unfair.

12:53.970 --> 12:56.080
Unfair? Why?

12:56.530 --> 12:59.800
I can't believe you guys 
get to bathe with such warm water.

12:59.800 --> 13:04.490
I used to have to bathe in cold water 
from lakes and rivers, you know.

13:04.840 --> 13:06.090
And, also,

13:07.250 --> 13:09.760
it's unfair that your 
sleeping space is so soft!

13:09.760 --> 13:11.810
It's so fluffy!

13:11.810 --> 13:13.600
I see. I'm glad you like it.

13:14.350 --> 13:17.210
But, on the surface, everything was in ruins.

13:17.590 --> 13:20.120
The demons really are 
occupying it, aren't they?

13:20.730 --> 13:21.680
Yeah.

13:22.210 --> 13:26.780
I was skeptical at first, 
but meeting you has confirmed it.

13:28.090 --> 13:29.470
We're in a world

13:29.470 --> 13:33.140
where the results of the Great War of 
the Five Races are inverted.

13:33.700 --> 13:36.140
The results are... inverted?

13:37.690 --> 13:42.250
Let's say the correct history 
is the one where we remember Sid.

13:42.640 --> 13:44.480
Then how about this one?

13:44.480 --> 13:47.050
I suppose it'd be considered 
an alternate history.

13:47.050 --> 13:51.350
Then all we need to do is escape from 
this one and return to the correct one!

13:51.740 --> 13:54.930
Yeah. I just hope there's 
a way <i>to</i> do that.

14:05.950 --> 14:07.010
Kai!

14:07.010 --> 14:07.650
Huh?

14:11.890 --> 14:14.970
I sense strong magic. The demons are here!

14:18.730 --> 14:20.500
<i>Enemy race invasion.</i>

14:20.500 --> 14:23.200
<i>All residents immediately 
evacuate to the shelter.</i>

14:23.840 --> 14:25.450
<i>I repeat.</i>

14:25.450 --> 14:27.010
<i>Enemy race invasion.</i>

14:29.800 --> 14:32.080
I didn't realize it was this bad.

14:32.770 --> 14:33.670
Kai?

14:34.460 --> 14:38.030
For humanity to be cornered this far.

14:38.130 --> 14:40.400
Someone!

14:38.130 --> 14:40.400
Please help!

14:39.740 --> 14:42.080
<i>That there's no one who can save them.</i>

14:44.390 --> 14:45.480
Sorry, Rinne.

14:45.940 --> 14:46.990
Please let me go.

14:47.460 --> 14:51.050
The only person in this world 
who can play Sid's role

14:51.050 --> 14:52.570
is probably me.

15:05.800 --> 15:07.570
No, it's not working at all!

15:07.570 --> 15:08.970
Saki, get the machine gun!

15:08.970 --> 15:09.840
Understood!

15:19.700 --> 15:20.730
Duck, Saki!

15:25.220 --> 15:26.030
Kai?!

15:26.030 --> 15:27.300
Saki, use water!

15:27.300 --> 15:28.180
What?

15:28.180 --> 15:31.680
When those stone bodies absorb water, 
they become too heavy to fly.

15:31.680 --> 15:33.590
Then hit them with grenades.

15:36.860 --> 15:38.040
Damn it.

16:09.260 --> 16:12.170
You really are strong enough to 
pick a fight with Vanessa, aren't you?

16:12.170 --> 16:13.280
Right? Aren't I?

16:13.280 --> 16:15.710
If you're going to fight, Kai, then I am, too!

16:16.650 --> 16:18.330
Still...

16:20.740 --> 16:21.870
Hey, Kai!

16:21.870 --> 16:23.460
What was that bullet from a second ago?!

16:23.460 --> 16:24.580
It canceled magic?!

16:24.580 --> 16:27.160
You were knocking back those demons 
with your fist, weren't you?!

16:27.160 --> 16:28.670
What kind of martial art is that?!

16:29.290 --> 16:34.570
I came from a world where humans 
won the Great War of the Five Races.

16:35.060 --> 16:38.560
The fighting style and 
the lightning-type bullet from earlier

16:38.560 --> 16:40.210
are both from that world.

16:40.210 --> 16:42.440
A world where humanity won?

16:42.440 --> 16:44.070
What are you talking—

16:45.850 --> 16:47.520
<i>This is the ground surveillance team!</i>

16:47.520 --> 16:49.680
<i>Two scout demons have escaped!</i>

16:50.930 --> 16:53.550
They found out about the whereabouts 
of the underground city.

16:53.550 --> 16:55.790
Next time, there will be even more demons.

16:55.790 --> 16:57.130
No way.

16:57.130 --> 16:58.490
I'll report to headquarters.

17:00.340 --> 17:01.780
Hey, Kai.

17:01.780 --> 17:04.500
Could you come with us 
to the rebel army headquarters?

17:04.930 --> 17:06.060
Is that okay?

17:06.060 --> 17:09.500
Considering how strong you are, 
I'm sure Jeanne-sama would welcome you.

17:11.420 --> 17:12.550
All right.

17:15.480 --> 17:19.780
The Urza Federation Rebel Army Headquarters 
is located in the old royal capital, right?

17:19.780 --> 17:21.770
Wasn't it in ruins?

17:22.150 --> 17:23.870
That's exactly why it's there.

17:23.870 --> 17:26.670
The demons wouldn't even think 
to look for humans there.

17:26.670 --> 17:29.310
You're right. It'd be a blind spot.

17:29.740 --> 17:33.760
It was suggested by the former 
commander, Jeanne-sama's father.

17:34.190 --> 17:35.920
How is he?

17:36.710 --> 17:38.910
He retired due to an injury two years ago.

17:39.310 --> 17:42.290
And Jeanne-sama became his successor.

17:42.290 --> 17:43.660
I see.

17:52.810 --> 17:56.010
I'm Kai Sakura Vento. 
This is my companion, Rinne.

17:56.490 --> 17:59.120
Yes. I've received the report.

17:59.610 --> 18:00.970
Tell me what happened.

18:02.570 --> 18:06.230
You're saying you came from a world where 
humanity won the Great War of the Five Races?!

18:06.230 --> 18:07.980
Enough with the jokes, brat!

18:07.980 --> 18:09.530
You and your shameless claims!

18:09.530 --> 18:11.620
This is just a waste of time!

18:11.620 --> 18:15.400
The other day, you spoke as if you knew me.

18:16.110 --> 18:18.090
In this alternate history you speak of,

18:18.090 --> 18:20.640
what kind of relationship did you and I have?

18:21.700 --> 18:24.940
We were colleagues... and childhood friends.

18:25.810 --> 18:28.090
You always talked my ear off.

18:28.090 --> 18:30.170
How you wanted to be like Aug and Ger.

18:29.250 --> 18:30.170
Those names...

18:34.230 --> 18:35.210
Jeanne-sama?

18:35.210 --> 18:36.110
No...

18:36.460 --> 18:38.030
We'll end it here today.

18:41.930 --> 18:45.310
So fluffy! I love it!

18:47.800 --> 18:49.890
We'd like to have a word with both of you.

18:49.890 --> 18:51.730
Jeanne-sama awaits.

18:53.800 --> 18:55.900
I heard from senior soldier Saki.

18:56.370 --> 19:01.800
The gargoyle's weakness. Was that intel 
from the world you were from?

19:01.800 --> 19:05.380
Yeah. You believe my story, then?

19:06.020 --> 19:10.260
Your knowledge and your battle skills... 
if we can utilize them, we will.

19:10.260 --> 19:11.420
That's all there is to it.

19:15.580 --> 19:17.630
Good evening, Kai.

19:17.630 --> 19:18.920
And you, Rinne.

19:19.260 --> 19:21.930
Jeanne... Just as I thought, 
you were dressed as a man.

19:21.930 --> 19:27.140
The only ones who know I'm a woman 
are Falin and veteran executives.

19:28.060 --> 19:29.930
Does this mean you believe me?

19:30.780 --> 19:36.310
Aug and Ger... I was surprised you knew 
my father and grandfather's nicknames,

19:36.310 --> 19:39.380
but it doesn't mean 
I believe everything you said.

19:40.080 --> 19:43.940
However, your knowledge 
and battle skills are worth banking on.

19:44.650 --> 19:46.620
That is why I need your help.

19:46.960 --> 19:48.340
What do you intend to do?

19:49.170 --> 19:51.560
We'll coordinate 
with the other five human cities

19:51.560 --> 19:55.840
to surround and repel the demons 
that tried to invade Neo Vashal.

19:56.220 --> 20:00.210
If we succeed, we won't have to 
abandon Neo Vashal.

20:00.210 --> 20:02.550
You're going to resist them to the end, huh?

20:03.100 --> 20:06.200
I'll offer fair rewards. 
I'd like your cooperation.

20:06.200 --> 20:07.100
Hey.

20:07.540 --> 20:09.350
I don't think that will end things.

20:10.120 --> 20:12.300
You might be able to strike back at them.

20:12.300 --> 20:15.940
But that retaliation is going to draw 
more and more demons here.

20:16.500 --> 20:17.440
I know.

20:17.740 --> 20:19.780
On top of that, if a high-rank demon appears,

20:19.780 --> 20:22.120
one blast of its magic could 
blow away the entire city!

20:22.120 --> 20:22.860
I know!

20:23.460 --> 20:24.970
Still, we have no choice...

20:26.250 --> 20:28.330
We should attack the royal capital.

20:28.330 --> 20:28.990
What?

20:29.450 --> 20:31.520
There's only one demon we should aim for.

20:31.980 --> 20:35.640
The hero of the demons, 
the Dark Empress Vanessa.

20:36.840 --> 20:38.590
Are you seriously suggesting that?

20:39.260 --> 20:40.860
That thing is a monster.

20:40.860 --> 20:43.130
Thirty years ago, all by itself,

20:43.420 --> 20:47.740
it wiped out the capital's defense forces 
and occupied the government palace.

20:48.800 --> 20:51.900
<i><i>And the only thing 
that's going to work on that monster</i></i>

20:51.900 --> 20:55.820
<i>is Sid's sword, the Code Holder.</i>

21:01.320 --> 21:02.320
I know.

21:02.660 --> 21:06.440
That's why the two of us will be 
the only ones to fight it directly.

21:06.440 --> 21:07.530
The two of you?!

21:07.870 --> 21:12.830
In the history I know, a man named Sid 
defeated Vanessa all by himself.

21:14.180 --> 21:17.530
Are you capable of doing the same?

21:18.530 --> 21:20.130
I'll do my best.

21:20.130 --> 21:23.670
What's in it for you?

21:25.300 --> 21:27.000
I've been thinking about it for a while.

21:28.020 --> 21:31.140
You're right. I came from another world.

21:32.150 --> 21:35.850
There's no reason for me 
to put myself in danger for this world.

21:36.510 --> 21:37.440
But...

21:38.270 --> 21:41.900
Ashran and Saki were fighting for their lives.

21:42.790 --> 21:46.380
Even if I were to abandon this world 
and return to my own,

21:46.380 --> 21:48.720
I wouldn't be able to face them.

21:48.720 --> 21:49.740
Kai...

21:52.290 --> 21:56.580
The demons are more on the lookout for 
the other three races than humans.

21:57.300 --> 22:01.020
That's why the majority of their forces 
are deployed near the border.

22:01.510 --> 22:04.070
The demons near the royal capital 
make up 10 percent of the force at most.

22:05.010 --> 22:10.010
While we fight Vanessa, I'd like the rebel 
army to keep the other demons occupied.

22:10.570 --> 22:14.920
If we put all our efforts into it, 
we could hold them off for a few hours.

22:14.920 --> 22:19.580
But by the time we reach the government 
palace, most of our troops will be killed.

22:19.580 --> 22:21.660
There's a way in from underground.

22:24.350 --> 22:25.940
In the back of the palace,

22:25.940 --> 22:30.120
there is a private underground train line 
that the royal family used to use as refuge.

22:30.120 --> 22:32.580
Civilians don't know about it,
 let alone demons.

22:33.090 --> 22:36.870
Falin, why didn't you tell me 
about this strategic information?

22:38.070 --> 22:39.640
This strategy was devised

22:39.640 --> 22:41.880
fifteen years ago, by your predecessor.

22:42.190 --> 22:43.340
My father did?!

22:43.930 --> 22:45.210
However, at the time,

22:45.210 --> 22:47.410
there was no means to defeat Vanessa,

22:47.410 --> 22:48.550
so he abandoned the idea.

22:49.630 --> 22:50.720
Even so,

22:51.060 --> 22:54.380
why wouldn't he tell me, the one who 
succeeded him as Commander?

22:54.380 --> 22:56.350
Because you're his daughter, I suspect.

22:57.080 --> 23:00.160
He planned to charge into the government 
palace and challenge Vanessa.

23:00.590 --> 23:02.660
No parent would want 
their daughter to go along

23:02.660 --> 23:04.320
with a reckless operation like that.

23:05.930 --> 23:07.560
It's just as he says.

23:09.870 --> 23:10.890
You idiot.

23:11.860 --> 23:13.300
My apologies.

23:13.780 --> 23:17.000
But I found myself wanting 
to bet on him as well.

23:18.420 --> 23:19.910
I'm going to fight, too!

23:22.840 --> 23:24.420
We'll immediately hold a strategy meeting.

23:24.940 --> 23:28.410
If we hesitate, Neo Vashal will be attacked.

23:28.410 --> 23:29.140
Right.

23:30.300 --> 23:31.510
Let's do this.

23:31.850 --> 23:34.280
A challenge against the hero of the demons...

23:36.090 --> 23:39.310
We'll reclaim the Urza Federation.
